#: ../../config/options_interface_coverart_box.rst:6
msgid "Picard version 3 introduced the ability to display selected details in the Coverart section without having to specifically click :guilabel:`Show more details`, such as:"
msgstr ""
"Picard 版本 3 引入了无需特别单击 :guilabel:`显示更多细节` 的能力，可以在封面"
"图片部分显示选定的详细信息，例如："

#: ../../config/options_interface_coverart_box.rst:21
msgid "The user can select which details appear in this section."
msgstr "用户可以选择在此部分显示哪些详细信息。"
